<p>(a) Operating income for the quarter ended March 31, 1996 included a charge of $14.2 million ($9.4 million after tax, or $.13 a share) related to the bankruptcy of Dutch plane-maker Fokker, a major aerospace customer. Excluding this charge, first quarter 1996 operating income for the aerospace segment and the company would have been $10.0 and $35.5 million, respectively.</p>
<p>Full company name is Coltec Industries Inc.</p>
